{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"三十有一年春，取濟西田。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"公子遂如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"夏四月，四卜郊，不從，乃免牲。猶三望。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"秋七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"冬，杞伯姬來求婦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"狄圍衛。十有二月，衛遷于帝丘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"三十一年春，取濟西田，分曹地也。使臧文仲往，宿於重館。重館人告曰：「晉新得諸侯，必親其共，不速行，將無及也。」從之，分曹地自洮以南，東傅于濟，盡曹地也。襄仲如晉，拜曹田也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"夏四月，四卜郊，不從，乃免牲，非禮也。猶三望，亦非禮也。禮不卜常祀，而卜其牲、日。牛，卜日曰牲。牲成而卜郊，上怠慢也。望，郊之細也。不郊，亦無望可也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"秋，晉蒐于清原，作五軍以禦狄。趙衰為卿。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"冬，狄圍衛，衛遷于帝丘。卜曰三百年。衛成公夢康叔曰：「相奪予享。」公命祀相。甯武子不可，曰：「鬼神非其族類，不歆其祀。杞、鄫何事？相之不享，於此久矣，非衛之罪也。不可以間成王、周公之命祀。請改祀命。」","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_94_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_94","textTraditional":"鄭洩駕惡公子瑕，鄭伯亦惡之，故公子瑕出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}